23ox|n|A catch to hold the wheel of a carriage on a declivity. ; A piece, as a lever, which is connected with a catch or detent as a means of releasing it; especially (Firearms), the part of a lock which is moved by the finger to release the cock and discharge the piece.	a:1tjh,71,12;197b,43,2~1tjh,71,12;197b,43,2	n:1lpe,66,6;197b,33,1~1lpe,66,6;197b,33,1	N:1umw,53,2;le3,42,3;x7z,41,4;1jvx,31,12;1khh,11,2~1jvx,31,12;x7z,41,4;le3,42,3;1umw,53,2;1khh,11,2
